  # Azure Gather Victim Data
  
  *Threat vector · `threat::1.0` · version 1 · modified 2026-01-02 · TLP:CLEAR*
  
  Adversary gathers victim cloud account inventory and telemetry context.
  
  | Property | Value |
  | --- | --- |
  | Criticality | High |
  | Severity | High |
  | Kill chain | Reconnaissance |
  | Surface | Azure |
  | Actors | [Enterprise] APT-C-23 |
  | ATT&CK | [`T1589`](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1589) Gather Victim Identity Information |
  | Detection coverage | 1 objective, 1 rule |
  
  **On this page:** [Assessment](#assessment) · [Surface](#surface) · [Actors](#actors) · [ATT&CK techniques](#attck-techniques) · [Chaining](#chaining) · [Detection coverage](#detection-coverage) · [Metadata](#metadata)
  
  ## Assessment
  
  **Criticality: High**. A High priority incident is likely to result in a demonstrable impact to public health or safety, national security, economic security, foreign relations, civil liberties, or public confidence.
  
  **Terrain:** Cloud identity and Azure account inventory telemetry.
  
  **Kill chain** (phase 1 of 18): **Reconnaissance** → Weaponization → Delivery …
  
  | Dimension | Assessment | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | Severity | High | - |
  | Impact | Credential Exposure | - |
  | Leverage | High | - |
  | Viability | Medium | - |
  | Kill chain | Reconnaissance | Researching, identifying and selecting targets using active or passive reconnaissance. |
  
  ## Surface
  
  | Surface | Description |
  | --- | --- |
  | Azure | Microsoft Azure cloud platform |
  
  ## Actors
  
  | Actor | ID | Source | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | [[Enterprise] APT-C-23](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1028) | `att&ck::G1028` | att&ck | [APT-C-23](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1028) is a threat group that has been active since at least 2014. |
  
  ## ATT&CK techniques
  
  | Technique | Name | Tactics | Summary |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | [`T1589`](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1589) | Gather Victim Identity Information | Reconnaissance | Adversaries may gather information about the victim's identity that can be used during targeting. |
  
